    "name": "Ground decals",
    "description": "p309 D1: the toolkit's ground decals in the DECAL packing (albedoAlpha: sRGB albedo, A opacity; normalRough: normal XY, roughness, A the puddle mask), a 4 \u00d7 4 grid of 512 cells with 16 px of padding (480\u00b2 of content; levels 0-4), but tireTracks, a 1024 \u00d7 256 strip at its source's 4:1 (992 \u00d7 224 of content), the grid cell under it and the last one free. tireTracks (ambientCG TireTracks001) and asphaltDamage (AsphaltDamage001) from their pack recipes (decalTireTracks01/, decalAsphaltDamage01/); the other cells are placeholders (source/placeholder.png, a grey crossed square, in albedoAlpha; normalRough's fill) until p309 Phase 5's generators. A cell's data: physicalSize in m, tileAlong, opacitySource, and a placeholder's generator."
